<title>KUWAIT: Italy's Snamprogetti in $96mln Kuwait deal.</title>
<headline>Italy's Snamprogetti in $96mln Kuwait deal.</headline>
<dateline>KUWAIT 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Snamprogetti, a unit of Italy's ENI energy group, has won a $96 million deal to build a water injection plant at Kuwait's Sabriyah oil field, industry sources said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>&quot;Snamprogetti was awarded the deal to build the water injection plant,&quot; said a source close to the project. &quot;The project would be launched soon,&quot; he added.</p>
</text>
